# Copy to .env.local for local online play, or add both as Environment Variables in Vercel.
# Find them in Supabase: Project Settings -> API (Project URL, and the "anon public" key).
# The anon key is meant to be public; the game only uses Realtime broadcast/presence, no tables.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
